# Meetings
**Last updated:** {{TODAY_DATE}}
**Parent:** [[knowledge-base]]

One row per tracked meeting series: its home file, its space and its calendar match patterns. {{INSTANCE_NAME}} matches calendar events against this list before it knows the space, so attendees and themes stay out of it. Each series' home file (`<space>/meetings/<slug>/<slug>.md`) holds its purpose, attendees, running themes and `calendar_match` patterns; its dated occurrence files (`<space>/meetings/<slug>/YYYY-MM-DD.md`, `type: meeting-occurrence`) hold prep, notes and synthesis.

