*Meetings will be auto-detected from your calendar during the first briefing run. You can also add them manually.*

## Calendar Matching

{{INSTANCE_NAME}} matches calendar events against the Calendar match column above (the same patterns as `calendar_match` in each home file's frontmatter). Matching is case-insensitive substring matching against event titles.

